.DS_Store
# Phase 2 experiment outputs are published (validation-only); bulky fold models and
# per-run directories are not. results/snapshots/ stays ignored (every dirty-tree run, tests
# included, writes one); snapshots referenced by a published manifest are force-added
# (`git add -f`), and tests/test_phase3.py fails if one is missing or its hash does not match.
!results/phase2/
results/phase2/**/models/
results/phase2/repro/*/*/
# dashboard: dependencies, build output and generated data (rebuilt from results/ by CI)
dashboard/node_modules/
dashboard/dist/
dashboard/public/data/
